domain meta-workflow

@"Given a subject description and a set of relevant rule ids, such that the rules provide constraints the subject."
+"This resolves the standard form of the subject following the constraints. Constraint rules must provide literal[] as their results."
rule resolve-with-constraints<T> for
  subjectDescription(literal), constraintRules(literal[])
given:
  collectedConstraints:
    seq result of apply-rule<literal[]> where ruleId = iter $constraintRules
  mergedConstraints:
    result of concat-arrays<literal[]> where arrays = $collectedConstraints
  finalValue:
    ref(T)
        "The final, constrained value for the subject described by: \"{$subjectDescription}\"."
       +"\nYou must try to satisfy all of the following constraints, where if there are conflicts, try to respect their priorities:"
       +"\n{$mergedConstraints}"
       +"\nCRITICAL: You are FORBIDDEN from using, applying any of these rule ids:"
       +"\n{$constraintRules}"